# LT6911C: rising edges trigger the read; insert, 720p, unplug.
chip c
board beta
file /etc/kvm/hdmi_mode 0
file /kvmapp/kvm/state 0\n
file /kvmapp/kvm/width 1920\n
file /kvmapp/kvm/height 1080\n
vidbg auto
call init
at 1500
src 1920 1080
int rise
at 1600
call mjpeg 1920 1080 80 every 100 until 3000
at 3000
src 1280 720
int fall
int rise
at 3100
call mjpeg 1280 720 80 every 100 until 6000
at 6000
src off
int fall
int rise
at 6100
call mjpeg 1280 720 80 every 500 until 8000
call signal
at 8000
end
